WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:41.200
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:41.470 --> 00:42.600
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:38.070 --> 01:43.930
[Small Town Remedy]

4
01:44.280 --> 01:46.610
[Episode 2]

5
01:49.000 --> 01:52.960
[Director's Office]

6
01:50.680 --> 01:51.539
Director Chen.

7
01:51.590 --> 01:53.120
Knock the door.

8
01:53.560 --> 01:55.220
Director Chen, I need a favor.

9
01:55.310 --> 01:55.950
I'm off work.

10
01:55.950 --> 01:57.610
Let's talk about it tomorrow.

11
01:58.710 --> 02:00.370
Director Chen, I need a favor.

12
02:02.870 --> 02:03.400
Go ahead.

13
02:05.350 --> 02:06.810
Liu Zhengliang's brother

14
02:06.950 --> 02:08.150
has a cerebral vascular malformation.

15
02:08.150 --> 02:09.810
The lesion's in a tricky spot.

16
02:09.919 --> 02:11.980
Director Nie can't handle this case.

17
02:12.120 --> 02:14.080
So Liu is thinking of coming to our hospital

18
02:14.080 --> 02:15.360
to do the surgery for his brother.

19
02:15.360 --> 02:16.120
But

20
02:17.750 --> 02:19.240
about changing

21
02:19.240 --> 02:20.570
his practice location,

22
02:20.750 --> 02:22.430
you have to find a way to get it done for him.

23
02:22.430 --> 02:23.690
I can't help with that.

24
02:24.400 --> 02:26.079
You think the hospital is your own family's business?

25
02:26.079 --> 02:26.740
Seriously?

26
02:27.150 --> 02:28.010
Director Chen.

27
02:28.400 --> 02:30.240
I know you've got your ways.

28
02:30.240 --> 02:31.120
Come on, think of something.

29
02:31.120 --> 02:32.320
Can't help with that!

30
02:32.800 --> 02:34.470
Wait, you...

31
02:34.840 --> 02:35.520
How about this?

32
02:35.520 --> 02:37.240
We tell everyone I'm the one performing the surgery,

33
02:37.240 --> 02:38.310
and then he operates on his brother instead.

34
02:38.310 --> 02:39.000
Is that okay?

35
02:39.000 --> 02:40.240
Are you out of your mind?

36
02:40.240 --> 02:41.430
You're in your thirties.

37
02:41.430 --> 02:42.079
What's going on

38
02:42.079 --> 02:43.000
in your head?

39
02:43.000 --> 02:43.590
But he's my buddy.

40
02:43.590 --> 02:44.240
Is that

41
02:44.240 --> 02:45.680
something a normal doctor

42
02:45.680 --> 02:46.960
would say?

43
02:46.960 --> 02:47.470
I...

44
02:47.470 --> 02:48.560
Your buddy...

45
02:48.560 --> 02:50.310
You've got some nerve now, huh?

46
02:50.310 --> 02:51.680
Who will take the blame if something goes wrong?

47
02:51.680 --> 02:53.240
Even if I can't take it, you can!

48
02:53.240 --> 02:53.870
Me?

49
02:53.870 --> 02:54.400
Yeah.

50
02:54.520 --> 02:55.120
So you think

51
02:55.120 --> 02:56.120
I'm living too comfortably now,

52
02:56.120 --> 02:57.310
and you want to land me in jail

53
02:57.310 --> 02:58.360
eating prison food?

54
02:58.360 --> 02:58.680
What are you doing?

55
02:58.680 --> 02:59.400
Aren't you my dad?

56
02:59.400 --> 03:00.200
I am your dad!

57
03:00.280 --> 03:01.010
Your dad...

58
03:01.080 --> 03:02.750
D-Don't hit me!

59
03:04.560 --> 03:05.190
Just you wait!

60
03:05.190 --> 03:06.470
I'm going to tell my mom!

61
03:06.470 --> 03:07.190
You can't!

62
03:08.960 --> 03:10.960
Threatening me with your mom again.

63
03:15.660 --> 03:17.060
I don't want the surgery.

64
03:17.150 --> 03:18.880
You'll die if you don't have it.

65
03:19.250 --> 03:21.010
Stop scaring me, okay?

66
03:21.310 --> 03:22.630
I'll die if I don't have it?

67
03:22.630 --> 03:23.940
I feel like I'm all better

68
03:23.940 --> 03:24.470
now.

69
03:24.750 --> 03:26.430
I can even recite ancient poems.

70
03:26.430 --> 03:27.590
"Moonlight before my bed,

71
03:27.590 --> 03:29.190
like frost upon the ground."

72
03:29.680 --> 03:30.870
I can even sing.

73
03:31.590 --> 03:32.870
"Imperial Jade Wine

74
03:32.870 --> 03:34.310
costs 180 yuan per cup.

75
03:34.520 --> 03:36.380
Just listen to my silver tongue."

76
03:37.650 --> 03:39.020
Hey. Hey.

77
03:40.120 --> 03:40.960
Keep it down.

78
03:40.980 --> 03:42.870
We're talking about his condition here.

79
03:42.870 --> 03:44.079
I'm not scaring you.

80
03:44.079 --> 03:46.079
You're just feeling better for now.

81
03:46.079 --> 03:46.960
If we don't get rid

82
03:46.960 --> 03:47.710
of the lesion completely,

83
03:47.710 --> 03:48.770
it'll bleed again,

84
03:48.840 --> 03:50.470
and then you'll go see our mom.

85
03:50.470 --> 03:51.710
Don't mention our mom.

86
03:51.710 --> 03:53.130
Okay, okay.

87
03:53.310 --> 03:54.640
Don't let him get to you.

88
03:55.840 --> 03:56.680
But,

89
03:56.750 --> 03:57.560
regarding your condition,

90
03:57.560 --> 03:59.190
he really wasn't scaring you.

91
03:59.190 --> 04:00.190
Just now,

92
04:00.590 --> 04:01.190
when I was talking to the doctor...

93
04:01.190 --> 04:02.680
Bro, can I use your apple?

94
04:03.150 --> 04:04.350
Don't you believe me?

95
04:04.960 --> 04:06.400
Of course I believe you.

96
04:06.910 --> 04:08.510
It's a craniotomy after all.

97
04:09.000 --> 04:11.150
At the very least, he can't be the one operating on me, right?

98
04:11.150 --> 04:12.150
I'm not eating it!

99
04:12.560 --> 04:13.820
Liu Zhengguang, look.

100
04:14.240 --> 04:14.910
This is

101
04:14.910 --> 04:17.459
what your head will look like after a craniotomy.

102
04:17.459 --> 04:18.589
This part here

103
04:18.620 --> 04:19.589
is that bad thing

104
04:19.589 --> 04:20.519
in your brain.

105
04:21.000 --> 04:22.830
It's close to the part of your brain

106
04:22.830 --> 04:24.990
that controls language function.

107
04:25.920 --> 04:27.240
So the difficulty of this surgery

108
04:27.240 --> 04:27.920
is

109
04:27.920 --> 04:29.720
how to accurately and completely

110
04:29.720 --> 04:30.750
remove this vascular malformation,

111
04:30.750 --> 04:31.560
which is this bad thing,

112
04:31.560 --> 04:33.000
while ensuring

113
04:33.190 --> 04:34.830
that your language function

114
04:34.830 --> 04:35.690
isn't damaged.

115
04:37.070 --> 04:38.240
So this time, I...

116
04:39.390 --> 04:41.000
So this time, I'm planning

117
04:41.040 --> 04:42.190
to use

118
04:42.190 --> 04:43.610
an awake craniotomy.

119
04:43.950 --> 04:45.010
That is to say,

120
04:45.240 --> 04:47.200
during the surgery,

121
04:47.360 --> 04:48.270
after opening your skull,

122
04:48.270 --> 04:49.200
I'll wake you up,

123
04:49.210 --> 04:51.409
and then the two of us will work together

124
04:51.630 --> 04:53.630
to get this bad thing

125
04:55.360 --> 04:56.290
out of your head.

126
04:56.600 --> 04:57.659
Do you understand?

127
04:59.830 --> 05:01.160
With my head cracked open,

128
05:01.160 --> 05:02.220
I can still wake up?

129
05:02.800 --> 05:04.100
Most likely, yes.

130
05:04.270 --> 05:06.070
But if there's

131
05:06.070 --> 05:08.000
bleeding or a seizure during the surgery,

132
05:08.000 --> 05:09.390
there is still a surgical risk

133
05:09.390 --> 05:10.270
that you may never

134
05:10.270 --> 05:11.160
wake up again.

135
05:13.920 --> 05:15.080
No, I don't agree.

136
05:15.720 --> 05:16.870
I'd rather die

137
05:17.190 --> 05:18.160
than let you

138
05:18.160 --> 05:18.960
touch my head.

139
05:21.480 --> 05:22.410
Liu Zhengguang.

140
05:23.430 --> 05:24.510
Listen to me.

141
05:25.240 --> 05:28.370
I've got plenty of experience with surgeries like this.

142
05:28.600 --> 05:29.240
Letting me do it for you

143
05:29.240 --> 05:30.360
is better than letting some doctor from this crappy hospital

144
05:30.360 --> 05:31.310
do it for you, right?

145
05:31.310 --> 05:33.510
Stop talking. My head hurts.

146
05:33.510 --> 05:34.510
You can doubt

147
05:34.510 --> 05:35.680
our relationship,

148
05:35.680 --> 05:36.680
but you can't doubt

149
05:36.680 --> 05:37.740
my surgical skill.

150
05:38.510 --> 05:39.510
The quality of medical care in Guangzhou and Shenzhen

151
05:39.510 --> 05:40.310
is far better than that

152
05:40.310 --> 05:40.950
of this crappy place.

153
05:40.950 --> 05:43.159
Stop talking. My head hurts!

154
05:43.390 --> 05:45.190
It's okay. You can talk.

155
05:45.720 --> 05:46.560
I want to hear it.

156
05:46.560 --> 05:48.040
What does it have to do with you?

157
05:48.040 --> 05:49.480
You want to hear everything, huh?

158
05:49.480 --> 05:51.680
This is the first time I've seen someone

159
05:52.040 --> 05:53.370
who is so seriously ill.

160
05:53.720 --> 05:54.430
I want to hear it.

161
05:54.430 --> 05:55.830
Stop talking, all of you!

162
05:55.830 --> 05:56.720
Just let me be alone

163
05:56.720 --> 05:57.830
and calm down for a bit, okay?

164
05:57.830 --> 05:58.560
Please!

165
05:58.560 --> 05:59.360
Shut up!

166
06:00.830 --> 06:02.070
He's right.

167
06:02.390 --> 06:04.050
You really are seriously ill.

168
06:09.240 --> 06:11.240
You... go out and smoke a cigarette.

169
06:12.360 --> 06:13.160
I don't smoke.

170
06:14.680 --> 06:15.900
Can you pee?

171
06:18.310 --> 06:19.910
Or go do whatever you want!

172
06:20.800 --> 06:22.060
Give us a minute alone.

173
06:24.600 --> 06:25.790
Now get going.

174
06:25.820 --> 06:26.460
Come on.

175
06:27.310 --> 06:28.310
Don't be anxious.

176
06:28.390 --> 06:30.120
You can't be anxious right now.

177
06:30.120 --> 06:31.310
Seriously.

178
06:32.390 --> 06:33.190
Lie down.

179
06:35.310 --> 06:36.770
My head really hurts a bit.

180
06:45.680 --> 06:46.510
What's wrong?

181
06:46.950 --> 06:49.409
Why aren't you going in now that you're back?

182
06:51.630 --> 06:52.360
I'm sorry.

183
06:53.010 --> 06:54.810
I didn't get it done.

184
06:56.950 --> 06:57.560
Liu Zhengguang

185
06:57.560 --> 06:59.090
won't let me operate on him.

186
06:59.830 --> 07:00.750
What did he say?

187
07:01.190 --> 07:02.190
He said he'd rather die

188
07:02.190 --> 07:03.790
than let me cut his head open.

189
07:07.120 --> 07:08.870
Come on, we're both doctors.

190
07:08.870 --> 07:10.930
You should be able to understand him.

191
07:11.000 --> 07:11.560
As a patient,

192
07:11.560 --> 07:13.310
what he needs most right now is comfort.

193
07:13.310 --> 07:14.190
Comfort?

194
07:14.600 --> 07:15.800
Can comfort cure him?

195
07:16.310 --> 07:17.160
Come on.

196
07:18.070 --> 07:19.750
Besides, he's your brother.

197
07:20.060 --> 07:21.270
Try to be understanding.

198
07:21.270 --> 07:23.310
We need to figure a way out.

199
07:23.310 --> 07:24.310
What should we do?

200
07:30.480 --> 07:31.410
I'll make a call.

201
07:34.350 --> 07:38.320
[Contact]

202
07:38.390 --> 07:42.750
[Fucheng No. 1 Hospital]

203
07:49.720 --> 07:50.560
Hello, Jiang.

204
07:50.630 --> 07:51.270
I want to ask

205
07:51.270 --> 07:52.210
if there are any doctors in your hospital

206
07:52.210 --> 07:53.100
willing to take outside cases?

207
07:53.100 --> 07:59.000
[Fucheng No. 1 Hospital]

208
07:58.159 --> 07:59.310
What are you talking about?

209
07:59.310 --> 08:00.000
Yes.

210
08:00.000 --> 08:01.240
I don't have many friends.

211
08:01.240 --> 08:02.430
It's not your place to tell me that.

212
08:02.430 --> 08:03.760
Who do you think you are?

213
08:04.190 --> 08:04.720
Hello.

214
08:09.560 --> 08:10.160
Bro,

215
08:10.720 --> 08:13.180
looking for a doctor who does outside cases?

216
08:14.800 --> 08:16.630
Just tell me what the condition is,

217
08:16.630 --> 08:18.070
and I can get you any doctor you need.

218
08:18.070 --> 08:19.160
Got any from Guangdong?

219
08:19.160 --> 08:20.190
Absolutely.

220
08:20.190 --> 08:21.840
This is what I do.

221
08:22.000 --> 08:23.130
Come on, take a look.

222
08:25.980 --> 08:26.930
[Top Specialists from Hospitals Nationwide]

223
08:26.930 --> 08:30.940
[Name: Liu Zhengliang] [Department: Neurosurgery]

224
08:28.160 --> 08:30.000
Liu Zhengliang.

225
08:30.000 --> 08:31.010
He's from Fucheng.

226
08:31.010 --> 08:32.679
He and I grew up playing together.

227
08:32.679 --> 08:35.000
One phone call, and the surgery's arranged.

228
08:35.000 --> 08:35.929
Liu Zhengliang?

229
08:37.510 --> 08:38.909
I am Liu Zhengliang.

230
08:40.000 --> 08:42.000
Y-You are Liu Zhengliang,

231
08:42.000 --> 08:43.360
and you're waiting here to see a doctor?

232
08:43.360 --> 08:44.900
Are you out of your mind?

233
08:49.030 --> 08:50.430
Do you still remember me?

234
08:51.000 --> 08:51.870
No, I don't.

235
08:52.030 --> 08:52.960
Last night,

236
08:53.550 --> 08:55.480
I got something stuck in my windpipe.

237
08:55.480 --> 08:56.440
You thought of a way

238
08:56.440 --> 08:57.910
and fished it out with a fishing net.

239
08:57.910 --> 08:58.750
Remember?

240
09:03.000 --> 09:05.910
Which hospital are you with?

241
09:06.600 --> 09:07.390
I notice none of the nurses here

242
09:07.390 --> 09:08.750
seem to know you.

243
09:09.510 --> 09:11.330
Sir, I've got things to do.

244
09:15.910 --> 09:17.200
Anyone would be on edge.

245
09:17.200 --> 09:17.910
Really.

246
09:17.910 --> 09:18.480
Yeah.

247
09:20.150 --> 09:21.880
The kid's face kept going

248
09:21.960 --> 09:23.720
red one minute and pale the next.

249
09:23.720 --> 09:24.440
He was terrified.

250
09:24.440 --> 09:26.870
It's basic survival instinct. Fear is normal.

251
09:26.870 --> 09:27.550
Right.

252
09:28.150 --> 09:29.680
We have to understand that.

253
09:29.720 --> 09:30.360
Well,

254
09:30.670 --> 09:32.630
I made the call, but I couldn't find anyone.

255
09:32.630 --> 09:33.670
I'll contact Tiantan Hospital

256
09:33.670 --> 09:35.000
and send him to Beijing.

257
09:35.440 --> 09:37.000
What if his condition gets worse on the way?

258
09:37.000 --> 09:38.530
We can only take the gamble.

259
09:38.550 --> 09:39.270
Anyway, Liu Zhengguang

260
09:39.270 --> 09:40.960
doesn't want me to operate on him.

261
09:40.960 --> 09:41.910
Let fate decide.

262
09:41.910 --> 09:42.480
No.

263
09:42.480 --> 09:43.480
Your brother... You use your brother...

264
09:43.480 --> 09:44.150
Well,

265
09:44.790 --> 09:47.250
Zhengguang agreed to let you operate on him.

266
09:47.840 --> 09:49.370
How did you talk him into it?

267
09:50.750 --> 09:52.010
You think I'm like you?

268
09:52.440 --> 09:53.270
Waving a knife around

269
09:53.270 --> 09:55.200
and swinging it back and forth?

270
09:56.510 --> 09:57.670
Like some cold-faced mantis.

271
09:57.670 --> 09:59.070
What were you even doing?

272
09:59.960 --> 10:02.290
Even if it's just a double eyelid surgery,

273
10:02.510 --> 10:04.910
it would scare him, let alone a craniotomy.

274
10:05.840 --> 10:07.630
It's useless even if he's willing now.

275
10:07.630 --> 10:09.090
I'm not qualified to do it.

276
10:10.870 --> 10:11.440
You...

277
10:11.910 --> 10:13.000
How come you're not qualified

278
10:13.000 --> 10:14.550
all of a sudden?

279
10:15.150 --> 10:17.350
Then what were you doing there just now?

280
10:17.480 --> 10:19.480
Just showing off your knife skills?

281
10:20.510 --> 10:21.670
Forget it. We don't need you anymore.

282
10:21.670 --> 10:22.750
Now I know how you got

283
10:22.750 --> 10:23.910
that top-twenty ranking.

284
10:23.910 --> 10:25.240
We don't need you, okay?

285
10:25.870 --> 10:26.670
I'll pay

286
10:26.910 --> 10:27.790
to get a top doctor here.

287
10:27.790 --> 10:29.600
-It's not about the money. -We can't find anyone.

288
10:29.600 --> 10:31.000
Why can't we find anyone?

289
10:31.030 --> 10:32.320
Someone from Hong Kong? The US?

290
10:32.320 --> 10:32.750
Or...

291
10:32.750 --> 10:33.550
He might not even

292
10:33.550 --> 10:34.240
make it to Beijing,

293
10:34.240 --> 10:35.000
-let alone Hong Kong or the US. -Then what are we supposed to do?

294
10:35.000 --> 10:36.730
Then what are we supposed to do?

295
10:36.960 --> 10:38.030
Just wait?

296
10:38.030 --> 10:39.080
The three of us just stand here staring at each other?

297
10:39.080 --> 10:40.080
Just standing here like idiots?

298
10:40.080 --> 10:40.960
You're out of your depth here.

299
10:40.960 --> 10:41.600
Can you just

300
10:41.600 --> 10:42.500
shut up for a second?

301
10:42.500 --> 10:43.840
Stop blabbering!

302
10:45.240 --> 10:46.240
What the hell!

303
10:47.480 --> 10:48.200
Who do you think you are?

304
10:48.200 --> 10:49.030
Are you saying that to me?

305
10:49.030 --> 10:50.480
Do you have any sense at all?

306
10:50.480 --> 10:51.670
I've been looking out for him all these years,

307
10:51.670 --> 10:52.470
you know that?

308
10:53.030 --> 10:53.870
Oh, please.

309
10:54.080 --> 10:55.410
Who do you think you are?

310
10:55.440 --> 10:57.270
Liu Zhengguang is my brother.

311
10:57.320 --> 10:58.000
This is our family's business!

312
10:58.000 --> 10:59.270
Is it your place to tell me about it?

313
10:59.270 --> 11:00.080
Who do you think you are?

314
11:00.080 --> 11:01.200
You're pulling that Greater Bay Area crap on me,

315
11:01.200 --> 11:01.750
huh?

316
11:02.510 --> 11:03.360
You're back in the Northeast, you know?

317
11:03.360 --> 11:03.910
What's going on?

318
11:03.910 --> 11:05.040
Don't get physical.

319
11:06.320 --> 11:08.510
Chen... Chen Junnan... Chen Junnan...

320
11:08.510 --> 11:09.570
What are you doing?

321
11:10.670 --> 11:11.360
You're back in the Northeast.

322
11:11.360 --> 11:12.360
Nobody gets to act tough here,

323
11:12.360 --> 11:13.080
got it?

324
11:13.550 --> 11:14.480
I'm telling you,

325
11:14.960 --> 11:16.050
if you keep defying me,

326
11:16.050 --> 11:17.910
I'll knock you out with one punch!

327
11:19.150 --> 11:20.370
Call the police!

328
11:20.440 --> 11:22.040
Liu Zhengguang is so unlucky

329
11:22.240 --> 11:23.480
to have a brother like you.

330
11:23.480 --> 11:24.240
You idiot!

331
11:28.030 --> 11:28.910
You're so big and tall,

332
11:28.910 --> 11:30.770
and you can't even push a girl off?

333
11:30.840 --> 11:31.600
You try it!

334
11:32.670 --> 11:33.730
This crappy place.

335
11:33.840 --> 11:35.790
There are all kinds of savages here.

336
11:35.790 --> 11:37.150
What's wrong with this place?

337
11:37.150 --> 11:38.750
Didn't this place raise you?

338
11:38.910 --> 11:40.000
Full of savages.

339
11:41.080 --> 11:42.440
Well, Dr. Chen,

340
11:43.600 --> 11:45.320
I brought a box of tea for each of you,

341
11:45.320 --> 11:46.780
just to show my gratitude.

342
11:47.120 --> 11:48.250
I'll leave it to you.

343
11:48.870 --> 11:49.600
Don't go.

344
11:49.600 --> 11:50.840
That's very kind of you,

345
11:50.840 --> 11:51.960
but there are rules at our hospital.

346
11:51.960 --> 11:52.870
We can't take this.

347
11:52.870 --> 11:53.790
It's not a big gift.

348
11:53.790 --> 11:54.440
No, no, no.

349
11:54.440 --> 11:55.910
It's just a little token of appreciation from me.

350
11:55.910 --> 11:56.670
There are rules.

351
11:56.670 --> 11:57.550
Look, so many people are watching.

352
11:57.550 --> 11:58.000
Hold it for me for a second.

353
11:58.000 --> 11:59.360
I need to tie my shoelace.

354
11:59.360 --> 12:01.080
Everyone is staring.

355
12:02.750 --> 12:03.750
Sir, I really can't take it.

356
12:03.750 --> 12:04.320
Don't...

357
12:04.960 --> 12:06.150
It's already in your hands.

358
12:06.150 --> 12:06.550
Just take it.

359
12:06.550 --> 12:07.480
No, no, no. Take it back.

360
12:07.480 --> 12:08.550
Let's not keep passing it back and forth.

361
12:08.550 --> 12:09.960
Sir, take it back.

362
12:09.960 --> 12:11.510
Really. So many eyes are on us.

363
12:11.510 --> 12:12.600
I can't take anything from you.

364
12:12.600 --> 12:13.530
President Long.

365
12:15.960 --> 12:17.120
President Long.

366
12:18.600 --> 12:19.600
Isn't this Chen Kai?

367
12:19.600 --> 12:20.150
Yes.

368
12:20.150 --> 12:21.080
Long time no see.

369
12:21.550 --> 12:22.870
You know each other, Dad?

370
12:22.870 --> 12:23.450
What?

371
12:23.960 --> 12:25.840
The former president of the Second Hospital.

372
12:25.840 --> 12:26.970
My former superior.

373
12:28.120 --> 12:28.920
You look well.

374
12:29.750 --> 12:30.550
This is my son,

375
12:30.790 --> 12:31.600
Chen Junnan.

376
12:31.870 --> 12:32.930
Hello, President.

377
12:33.630 --> 12:35.030
Don't call me President.

378
12:35.150 --> 12:35.960
Call me Uncle.

379
12:36.240 --> 12:37.040
Hello, Uncle.

380
12:37.200 --> 12:38.120
I...

381
12:38.120 --> 12:39.120
This...

382
12:39.790 --> 12:40.590
You look well.

383
12:40.960 --> 12:42.390
I'm not at the Second Hospital anymore.

384
12:42.390 --> 12:43.720
I'm back at Xiaoximen Hospital.

385
12:43.720 --> 12:44.390
I know.

386
12:44.390 --> 12:45.320
You always go

387
12:45.320 --> 12:46.670
wherever you're needed the most.

388
12:46.670 --> 12:47.390
What's up?

389
12:47.390 --> 12:48.910
Why are you here today?

390
12:49.960 --> 12:50.960
Don't mention it.

391
12:51.240 --> 12:52.600
I ate something wrong yesterday,

392
12:52.600 --> 12:54.260
and it went down the windpipe.

393
12:54.750 --> 12:56.390
Your son saved me.

394
12:56.390 --> 12:57.440
I owe your son

395
12:58.240 --> 12:59.270
a huge favor.

396
12:59.320 --> 13:00.480
Long time no see.

397
13:00.910 --> 13:01.810
Let's have a drink.

398
13:01.810 --> 13:02.410
Chen.

399
13:02.440 --> 13:03.910
To be honest, I've quit drinking.

400
13:03.910 --> 13:04.840
What do you mean you've quit drinking?

401
13:04.840 --> 13:06.240
-I really have. -It's been a long time.

402
13:06.240 --> 13:06.840
Well,

403
13:07.360 --> 13:08.240
here's a box of tea for your dad.

404
13:08.240 --> 13:09.150
I'll take this box back.

405
13:09.150 --> 13:10.150
No need. No need.

406
13:10.150 --> 13:10.510
Just take it.

407
13:10.510 --> 13:11.200
No, no, no.

408
13:11.240 --> 13:11.870
You...

409
13:12.550 --> 13:13.270
Let's go.

410
13:13.270 --> 13:13.870
Let's have a drink.

411
13:13.870 --> 13:14.510
I really don't drink anymore.

412
13:14.510 --> 13:15.510
Then I'll go back.

413
13:15.510 --> 13:16.270
No, no, no.

414
13:16.270 --> 13:17.080
We don't get to see each other often.

415
13:17.080 --> 13:17.510
Uncle.

416
13:17.870 --> 13:20.360
Didn't you say

417
13:20.750 --> 13:22.840
y-you owe me a favor?

418
13:23.000 --> 13:23.790
So?

419
13:26.790 --> 13:28.050
Can you pay it back now?

420
13:29.790 --> 13:30.600
One minute you say you'll do it,

421
13:30.600 --> 13:31.320
and the next you say you won't.

422
13:31.320 --> 13:32.650
Are you messing with me?

423
13:33.510 --> 13:34.910
There's no other way now.

424
13:35.320 --> 13:36.450
This is the only way.

425
13:38.240 --> 13:39.200
Didn't you say going to Beijing

426
13:39.200 --> 13:40.320
carries even greater risks?

427
13:40.320 --> 13:41.120
That's right.

428
13:41.790 --> 13:42.790
On the way there, your condition

429
13:42.790 --> 13:44.250
can very likely get worse.

430
13:51.630 --> 13:52.560
Liu Zhengliang.

431
13:53.840 --> 13:54.270
I...

432
13:55.360 --> 13:56.960
If anything happens to me,

433
13:59.080 --> 14:00.210
you have to find Mom.

434
14:01.670 --> 14:02.530
Did you hear me?

435
14:04.360 --> 14:06.000
Rest assured.

436
14:07.440 --> 14:08.910
Just focus on yourself.

437
14:16.630 --> 14:18.290
Actually, I know everything.

438
14:22.000 --> 14:22.870
Say something.

439
14:22.870 --> 14:23.630
Know what?

440
14:24.870 --> 14:27.000
I know I'm not Mom's biological child.

441
14:27.000 --> 14:28.120
I was adopted.

442
14:33.960 --> 14:35.630
I saw with my own eyes

443
14:35.660 --> 14:38.080
that Mom was pregnant with you and gave birth to you.

444
14:38.080 --> 14:39.150
How could you possibly be adopted?

445
14:39.150 --> 14:40.360
What are you thinking?

446
14:40.360 --> 14:41.720
People at our age

447
14:41.720 --> 14:42.980
are all only children.

448
14:43.030 --> 14:43.910
When I was in school,

449
14:43.910 --> 14:45.270
all my classmates were only children.

450
14:45.270 --> 14:46.320
None of them had siblings.

451
14:46.320 --> 14:46.790
How do you explain that?

452
14:46.790 --> 14:48.390
You were born over the quota.

453
14:49.270 --> 14:51.080
Dad even paid a fine for you.

454
14:53.240 --> 14:55.300
He passed away right after paying it.

455
14:57.550 --> 14:59.870
Neat story. Sounds convincing.

456
15:00.360 --> 15:02.360
Unfortunately, I have solid proof.

457
15:02.840 --> 15:04.240
Mom sent you to the South.

458
15:04.240 --> 15:05.670
For all these years, she had no one by her side,

459
15:05.670 --> 15:07.030
so she chose me.

460
15:07.240 --> 15:09.240
She adopted me as your replacement.

461
15:09.600 --> 15:10.360
For all these years,

462
15:10.360 --> 15:11.670
I just couldn't figure it out.

463
15:11.670 --> 15:12.910
Mom talked about you every day.

464
15:12.910 --> 15:14.310
She missed you every day.

465
15:14.550 --> 15:15.550
I was by her side,

466
15:15.550 --> 15:16.480
keeping her company every day,

467
15:16.480 --> 15:17.810
but she just ignored me!

468
15:18.000 --> 15:19.660
Doesn't that say everything?

469
15:22.840 --> 15:23.670
I know

470
15:25.480 --> 15:27.870
it wasn't easy for Mom to raise me all these years.

471
15:27.870 --> 15:28.600
No matter

472
15:28.600 --> 15:30.030
whether I'm her biological son or not, I have to accept it.

473
15:30.030 --> 15:31.510
I still recognize her as my mom,

474
15:31.510 --> 15:33.170
and I have to do my duty as a son.

475
15:34.360 --> 15:35.080
I need

476
15:35.080 --> 15:36.120
to fulfill every son's obligation

477
15:36.120 --> 15:37.150
on your behalf.

478
15:39.270 --> 15:40.200
Liu Zhengguang,

479
15:41.080 --> 15:42.320
sometimes I really wish

480
15:42.320 --> 15:43.910
we weren't real brothers.

481
15:43.910 --> 15:46.270
See? You're telling the truth now.

482
15:46.270 --> 15:47.080
You're such an idiot.

483
15:47.080 --> 15:48.610
If you'd said so earlier...

484
15:49.550 --> 15:50.440
I've got a way.

485
15:51.020 --> 15:58.370
[The Old Captain]

486
15:54.550 --> 15:55.120
Listen.

487
15:56.670 --> 15:57.390
You sign an employment contract

488
15:57.390 --> 15:58.440
with Xiaoximen Hospital

489
15:58.440 --> 15:59.510
where I work.

490
15:58.500 --> 16:02.920
[Scallops with Vermicelli—Dig In!]

491
16:02.150 --> 16:03.670
I'll use my own methods

492
16:04.280 --> 16:06.370
♪ The sun's already high and I'm just getting downstairs ♪

493
16:04.320 --> 16:05.630
to get you registered

494
16:05.630 --> 16:06.750
as quickly as possible,

495
16:06.390 --> 16:08.700
♪ My hair is a flattened mess, like a bird's nest ♪

496
16:07.360 --> 16:09.360
so you can get your medical license.

497
16:09.680 --> 16:11.520
♪ There is nothing much in my pockets ♪

498
16:11.890 --> 16:13.910
♪ I still sway a little as I walk ♪

499
16:14.610 --> 16:15.770
♪ A buddy at the door calls out to me ♪

500
16:16.100 --> 16:17.040
♪ Where are you off to? ♪

501
16:17.360 --> 16:18.450
♪ I say I don't know yet ♪

502
16:18.710 --> 16:19.770
♪ Just gonna head on forward ♪

503
16:20.030 --> 16:22.410
♪ And see where I end up ♪

504
16:20.600 --> 16:21.670
But I have a few questions

505
16:21.670 --> 16:22.480
for you.

506
16:22.790 --> 16:24.600
♪ Anyway, there isn't much to do at home ♪

507
16:24.440 --> 16:25.120
Go ahead.

508
16:26.870 --> 16:27.720
Why were you

509
16:29.870 --> 16:31.870
fired from your previous hospital?

510
16:33.080 --> 16:34.150
Because I did

511
16:34.150 --> 16:36.030
an outside surgery that went very badly.

512
16:36.030 --> 16:37.090
Whose fault was it?

513
16:37.320 --> 16:37.840
Mine.

514
16:38.360 --> 16:40.150
After you finish the surgery for your brother,

515
16:40.150 --> 16:41.270
are you willing to stay at our hospital?

516
16:41.270 --> 16:42.030
No.

517
16:43.600 --> 16:44.660
What are you doing?

518
16:45.510 --> 16:48.240
We're here to get something done. Talk properly.

519
16:48.840 --> 16:50.550
After the surgery, I'm leaving.

520
16:50.550 --> 16:52.150
I have to go back to the South.

521
16:54.250 --> 16:55.240
Surgical skills,

522
16:55.240 --> 16:56.640
patient communication,

523
16:56.790 --> 16:57.920
clinical teaching,

524
16:58.360 --> 16:59.320
and research papers.

525
16:59.320 --> 17:00.240
On a scale of 1 to 10 for these five categories,

526
17:00.240 --> 17:01.840
how would you rate yourself?

527
17:02.360 --> 17:03.630
Eight. Nine.

528
17:05.440 --> 17:06.910
Three. Seven. Eight.

529
17:07.630 --> 17:09.630
So you have trouble communicating?

530
17:09.750 --> 17:10.680
I don't think so,

531
17:10.680 --> 17:11.589
but my former colleagues

532
17:11.589 --> 17:12.390
all think I do.

533
17:13.790 --> 17:15.480
You trust your colleagues' judgment

534
17:15.480 --> 17:16.540
more than your own?

535
17:18.160 --> 17:18.880
I just think

536
17:18.880 --> 17:19.920
patients and their families

537
17:19.920 --> 17:21.240
sometimes don't understand what I'm saying.

538
17:21.240 --> 17:24.440
Doesn't that still show you have trouble communicating?

539
17:26.240 --> 17:27.680
So you do or you don't?

540
17:29.270 --> 17:29.720
I do.

541
17:34.550 --> 17:35.640
Last question.

542
17:36.350 --> 17:37.550
Why should I help you?

543
17:37.920 --> 17:38.550
Uncle Long,

544
17:38.550 --> 17:39.920
don't you owe me a favor?

545
17:39.920 --> 17:41.200
When it's official business,

546
17:41.200 --> 17:42.530
call me President Long.

547
17:43.680 --> 17:44.640
I'm willing to sit down

548
17:44.640 --> 17:45.700
and give you ideas.

549
17:45.790 --> 17:47.720
That favor is basically repaid.

550
17:49.480 --> 17:50.740
Well, President Long,

551
17:50.920 --> 17:53.200
it seems that favor doesn't count for much.

552
17:53.200 --> 17:54.510
Special cases need special treatment.

553
17:54.510 --> 17:57.480
We've got to count both the onboarding and the offboarding.

554
17:57.480 --> 17:58.310
Understood.

555
17:59.030 --> 18:00.750
How about this, President Long?

556
18:00.750 --> 18:02.030
If you have any other conditions,

557
18:02.030 --> 18:02.830
just say them.

558
18:03.920 --> 18:04.880
There will be an extra fee.

559
18:04.880 --> 18:05.440
How much?

560
18:05.750 --> 18:06.310
20,000.

561
18:07.240 --> 18:08.400
It's not for me personally.

562
18:08.400 --> 18:10.440
You donate it directly to the hospital.

563
18:10.440 --> 18:11.750
Your brother's medical expenses

564
18:11.750 --> 18:13.070
will be calculated separately.

565
18:13.070 --> 18:14.330
I can issue an invoice.

566
18:14.350 --> 18:15.680
Uncle Long, this is robbery!

567
18:15.680 --> 18:16.480
Screw you.

568
18:18.480 --> 18:19.000
Okay.

569
18:19.650 --> 18:20.850
Okay?

570
18:20.880 --> 18:21.720
You're broke.

571
18:21.720 --> 18:22.510
Where are you gonna get so much money?

572
18:22.510 --> 18:23.480
How can you say okay?

573
18:23.480 --> 18:24.830
My mom's will says

574
18:24.880 --> 18:25.960
that she had some savings.

575
18:25.960 --> 18:27.400
Aren't you going to discuss it with your brother?

576
18:27.400 --> 18:28.880
What's there to discuss with him?

577
18:28.880 --> 18:31.540
The money will be used for his treatment anyway.

578
18:37.550 --> 18:38.310
Uncle Long, here's the thing.

579
18:38.310 --> 18:39.370
This friend of mine

580
18:39.960 --> 18:41.750
doesn't stay in Fucheng much.

581
18:41.750 --> 18:43.830
He doesn't know the situation here.

582
18:43.960 --> 18:45.160
If I may ask,

583
18:45.550 --> 18:46.350
are the medical facilities

584
18:46.350 --> 18:47.550
at Xiaoximen Hospital

585
18:47.550 --> 18:48.410
up to standard?

586
18:49.030 --> 18:51.430
Do you have a qualified anesthesiologist?

587
18:56.240 --> 18:57.160
I can bring in

588
18:57.160 --> 18:58.240
the best anesthesiologist

589
18:58.240 --> 18:59.240
from the city.

590
19:00.160 --> 19:00.750
As for the equipment,

591
19:00.750 --> 19:01.510
you can come to the hospital tomorrow morning

592
19:01.510 --> 19:02.750
and see for yourself.

593
19:04.270 --> 19:05.510
If you're satisfied,

594
19:05.590 --> 19:06.790
we'll sign the contract tomorrow noon,

595
19:06.790 --> 19:09.390
and the surgery will be the day after tomorrow.

596
19:09.570 --> 19:10.220
♪ Just wandering around ♪

597
19:10.750 --> 19:11.580
♪ Just wandering around ♪

598
19:11.910 --> 19:14.480
♪ This town is just so small ♪

599
19:13.470 --> 19:14.750
Alright, let's do that.

600
19:14.750 --> 19:15.510
Pleasure working with you.

601
19:14.800 --> 19:16.980
♪ Running into a former classmate on the east side ♪

602
19:17.150 --> 19:18.900
♪ Running into my uncle on the west side ♪

603
19:19.090 --> 19:20.240
♪ What're you looking at? ♪

604
19:19.480 --> 19:20.960
I... I'll get this. I'll get this.

605
19:20.510 --> 19:21.830
♪ Quit staring ♪

606
19:22.260 --> 19:24.590
♪ Staring won't change a thing ♪

607
19:25.110 --> 19:25.860
♪ Bored out of my mind ♪

608
19:26.110 --> 19:27.340
♪ I have a couple of drinks ♪

609
19:27.540 --> 19:30.500
♪ First one to pass out is a loser ♪

610
19:28.110 --> 19:29.590
Is he reliable?

611
19:30.750 --> 19:32.270
It's our only shot.

612
19:30.950 --> 19:32.060
♪ Just wandering around ♪

613
19:32.400 --> 19:33.550
We have to try.

614
19:32.500 --> 19:33.170
♪ Just wandering around ♪

615
19:33.570 --> 19:36.110
♪ Young people don't make that many plans ♪

616
19:34.030 --> 19:35.960
He's Chen Kai's old buddy.

617
19:36.310 --> 19:38.340
♪ The sun's pretty nice today ♪

618
19:37.000 --> 19:38.330
Come on, eat something.

619
19:38.810 --> 19:41.360
♪ Let's go out and not waste the day ♪

620
19:40.510 --> 19:41.270
Wait, that one's burnt.

621
19:41.270 --> 19:41.820
Have this one.

622
19:41.820 --> 19:42.360
♪ Let's go ♪

623
19:43.060 --> 19:43.930
♪ Where are you going? ♪

624
19:43.160 --> 19:44.160
I'm starving.

625
19:44.520 --> 19:45.140
♪ Don't know ♪

626
19:45.240 --> 19:45.960
Is it good?

627
19:45.560 --> 19:46.470
♪ Then why're you going? ♪

628
19:47.510 --> 19:48.920
I haven't eaten yet.

629
19:47.850 --> 19:49.110
♪ Just wandering around ♪

630
19:50.270 --> 19:51.070
Try it.

631
19:52.160 --> 19:58.820
[Mic King Zone] [Starry Night]

632
20:01.510 --> 20:03.970
That kid's research papers are pretty good.

633
20:05.110 --> 20:06.140
Jianguo,

634
20:06.270 --> 20:08.200
can you ask around about a guy for me?

635
20:08.200 --> 20:10.000
His name is Liu Zhengliang.

636
20:11.550 --> 20:12.200
Male.

637
20:12.510 --> 20:13.830
Age...

638
20:14.300 --> 20:16.160
Probably in his early thirties.

639
20:17.830 --> 20:20.200
He used to w-work

640
20:20.200 --> 20:21.460
at S-Shenya Hospital.

641
20:22.240 --> 20:23.220
Long, then

642
20:23.680 --> 20:25.010
what do you want to know?

643
20:26.270 --> 20:27.730
I want to know everything,

644
20:28.270 --> 20:30.030
but the most important thing

645
20:30.030 --> 20:31.890
is his professional competence.

646
21:02.160 --> 21:03.510
I'm the kid's uncle.

647
21:03.830 --> 21:05.290
We came to Beijing specifically for this.

648
21:05.290 --> 21:06.790
Doctor, please take a look.

649
21:06.790 --> 21:08.070
This kid's illness

650
21:08.070 --> 21:09.200
is very rare.

651
21:09.280 --> 21:11.550
It's a type of post-traumatic stress disorder.

652
21:09.570 --> 21:13.920
[Beijing]

653
21:12.400 --> 21:13.270
So far,

654
21:13.270 --> 21:14.030
there is no confirmed

655
21:14.030 --> 21:15.440
effective treatment.

656
21:18.350 --> 21:18.960
Doctor,

657
21:19.550 --> 21:21.590
is there any medicine for this?

658
21:22.000 --> 21:24.720
I've heard about qigong,

659
21:25.310 --> 21:26.110
hypnosis and stuff.

660
21:26.110 --> 21:26.840
Do they work?

661
21:27.790 --> 21:30.110
Don't go chasing all these random treatments.

662
21:30.110 --> 21:31.790
You'll end up hurting the kid.

663
21:32.070 --> 21:32.920
You may as well

664
21:32.920 --> 21:34.920
change the environment for the kid.

665
21:35.750 --> 21:37.310
Changing the environment will help?

666
21:37.310 --> 21:37.880
Yes.

667
21:44.880 --> 21:47.310
Mom, I don't want to go to Guangzhou.

668
21:47.310 --> 21:49.510
You're going whether you want to or not.

669
21:50.350 --> 21:51.680
See this jacket?

670
21:51.920 --> 21:52.750
Don't wash it.

671
21:53.440 --> 21:55.680
I sewed 100 yuan and a phone number

672
21:55.680 --> 21:56.720
in the pocket.

673
21:58.550 --> 22:00.210
You must listen to your uncle.

674
22:00.680 --> 22:02.270
If there's something urgent,

675
22:02.270 --> 22:04.440
use the money to call me.

676
22:04.790 --> 22:05.650
I'll go see you.

677
22:09.160 --> 22:09.680
Mom,

678
22:10.200 --> 22:11.920
are you sending me away

679
22:12.350 --> 22:14.550
because you have my little brother now?

680
22:35.720 --> 22:36.640
I want you to stay here

681
22:36.640 --> 22:37.900
more than anyone else.

682
22:38.830 --> 22:40.000
But you can't just hide at home

683
22:40.000 --> 22:41.480
every time winter comes.

684
22:43.400 --> 22:44.310
If you can't stay in the Northeast,

685
22:44.310 --> 22:45.910
then move to somewhere else.

686
22:47.000 --> 22:48.480
You have to live well.

687
22:54.350 --> 22:55.750
The snow in the Northeast

688
22:58.590 --> 22:59.790
is too heavy.

689
23:02.680 --> 23:04.310
The winter is too long.

690
23:22.590 --> 23:23.340
[Construction Area — No Climbing Over]

691
23:44.840 --> 23:50.220
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

692
23:51.310 --> 23:52.570
You're Dr. Liu, right?

693
23:53.590 --> 23:55.030
I'm Che Mingming from Neurosurgical Department.

694
23:55.030 --> 23:56.440
The president sent me to pick you up.

695
23:56.440 --> 23:57.300
Just follow me.

696
24:00.960 --> 24:01.550
What's wrong?

697
24:01.550 --> 24:02.610
You're not Dr. Liu?

698
24:04.110 --> 24:04.830
I am.

699
24:05.920 --> 24:06.780
Then follow me.

700
24:09.960 --> 24:11.880
[West Gate]

701
24:18.310 --> 24:19.920
I heard you're also a local.

702
24:20.550 --> 24:22.550
Haven't been back for years, right?

703
24:23.000 --> 24:24.730
Things have changed a lot here.

704
24:25.640 --> 24:26.200
This way.

705
24:26.710 --> 24:32.940
[Patient-Centered, Quality-Focused]

706
24:31.110 --> 24:32.270
When you came just now,

707
24:32.270 --> 24:33.510
you probably saw it too.

708
24:33.510 --> 24:35.640
There are commercial streets all around us.

709
24:35.640 --> 24:36.440
That's because

710
24:36.440 --> 24:37.590
we exchanged the old buildings facing the street

711
24:37.590 --> 24:38.160
with the builders

712
24:38.160 --> 24:39.350
who construct buildings

713
24:38.810 --> 24:42.290
[Clinical Laboratory] [Radiology Department]

714
24:39.680 --> 24:41.210
to rent out as storefronts.

715
24:41.990 --> 24:43.580
It was all our president's idea.

716
24:42.410 --> 24:48.250
[Outpatient Hall]

717
24:45.110 --> 24:46.070
When the new buildings are done,

718
24:46.070 --> 24:48.340
the president will get two more buildings for free.

719
24:48.340 --> 24:51.840
[Pharmacy]

720
24:48.480 --> 24:49.550
This place doesn't quite comply

721
24:49.550 --> 24:52.210
with the regulations for medical land, does it?

722
24:52.590 --> 24:53.680
What's the big deal?

723
24:53.680 --> 24:55.110
Our president has strong connections.

724
24:54.870 --> 25:00.500
[Treating patients with skill and compassion]

725
24:57.920 --> 24:59.000
There are two more doors here.

726
24:59.000 --> 25:00.330
They're all connected.

727
25:00.590 --> 25:01.520
Watch your step.

728
25:02.590 --> 25:05.110
The first and third floors here are outpatient clinics.

729
25:05.110 --> 25:07.510
Over there on the first floor is the emergency department.

730
25:07.510 --> 25:10.240
Further down are logistics and the cafeteria.

731
25:14.270 --> 25:15.640
Surgery is on the second floor.

732
25:15.640 --> 25:17.700
Further up are research and offices.

733
25:17.960 --> 25:21.220
The inpatient department is in the the building next door.

734
25:24.830 --> 25:26.680
These devices are all the latest.

735
25:26.680 --> 25:27.510
How about it?

736
25:27.680 --> 25:28.270
Not worse than those big hospitals

737
25:28.270 --> 25:30.050
in Shenzhen, right?

738
25:34.720 --> 25:36.320
I really didn't expect this.

739
25:36.640 --> 25:37.640
Such an inconspicuous hospital

740
25:37.640 --> 25:39.160
from the outside

741
25:40.110 --> 25:41.510
has quite reliable operating rooms.

742
25:41.510 --> 25:42.880
Our president has strong connections.

743
25:42.880 --> 25:45.350
These are all obtained through internal channels.

744
25:45.350 --> 25:45.830
Let's go.

745
25:45.830 --> 25:46.640
I'll take you to the ICU

746
25:46.640 --> 25:47.350
for a walk.

747
25:48.640 --> 25:50.120
I'm here to do surgery,

748
25:50.200 --> 25:51.530
not to visit.

749
25:51.790 --> 25:53.070
What's the harm in taking a look?

750
25:53.070 --> 25:54.270
You're already here.

751
25:54.510 --> 25:55.790
Our president told me

752
25:56.030 --> 25:57.030
that I must

753
25:57.030 --> 25:58.240
show you

754
25:58.240 --> 26:00.680
the hardware capabilities of our Xiaoximen Hospital.

755
26:00.680 --> 26:01.440
Let's go.

756
26:07.740 --> 26:13.200
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

757
26:10.070 --> 26:12.110
You don't even have money to build a building.

758
26:12.110 --> 26:14.200
Where did you get the money to buy these?

759
26:14.200 --> 26:15.000
Loans.

760
26:15.830 --> 26:16.590
Loans?

761
26:16.960 --> 26:17.790
Can you pay them back?

762
26:17.670 --> 26:22.710
[Keep the ward clean and tidy]

763
26:18.350 --> 26:19.480
So what if we can't?

764
26:19.830 --> 26:22.030
Our president has strong connections.

765
26:25.750 --> 26:27.480
Comrade Liu, how is it?

766
26:26.420 --> 26:30.210
[No smoking] [Keep quiet]

767
26:27.480 --> 26:28.540
Are you satisfied?

768
26:29.400 --> 26:30.530
Yes, I'm satisfied.

769
26:33.400 --> 26:35.400
The contract is ready. Just sign it.

770
26:37.480 --> 26:38.400
Sign it here?

771
26:38.880 --> 26:39.350
Then...

772
26:41.480 --> 26:42.750
Then sign it on my back.

773
26:53.680 --> 26:55.280
I need to read this contract.

774
26:55.590 --> 26:57.070
I was just afraid you were in a hurry.

775
26:57.070 --> 26:58.400
There's no rush for now.

776
26:58.960 --> 27:00.830
As if I could trick him.

777
27:03.200 --> 27:04.200
Then take your time

778
27:04.200 --> 27:04.880
and read it.

779
27:05.400 --> 27:06.860
I'm going to play mahjong.

780
27:07.240 --> 27:09.640
You're playing mahjong again, President?

781
27:09.640 --> 27:10.240
Once you start playing,

782
27:10.240 --> 27:11.510
it'll be a whole day and night.

783
27:11.220 --> 27:14.600
[To Building 2]

784
27:11.510 --> 27:12.680
Then who will stamp

785
27:12.680 --> 27:13.810
Dr. Liu's contract?

786
27:13.920 --> 27:15.650
He doesn't seem to be in a hurry.

787
27:15.680 --> 27:18.210
Isn't the patient arriving in the afternoon?

788
27:18.310 --> 27:20.680
Did you contact that anesthesiologist?

789
27:21.790 --> 27:24.400
I'll count down three numbers, and he'll definitely come over.

790
27:24.400 --> 27:25.110
Three...

791
27:25.640 --> 27:26.160
Two...

792
27:27.070 --> 27:27.680
One.

793
27:29.000 --> 27:29.660
Did he move?

794
27:32.790 --> 27:33.480
No.

795
27:34.770 --> 27:37.830
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

796
27:38.640 --> 27:40.000
This guy is too calm.

797
27:40.000 --> 27:41.350
He's just like me.

798
27:53.960 --> 27:54.720
What should we do?

799
27:54.720 --> 27:56.380
He's reading very carefully.

800
28:09.350 --> 28:10.640
I brought the bankbook.

801
28:10.640 --> 28:11.510
Where do I pay?

802
28:11.880 --> 28:13.200
No rush to pay.

803
28:13.920 --> 28:15.830
How do you feel about the contract?

804
28:15.830 --> 28:17.290
Your contract is not good.

805
28:17.920 --> 28:20.580
The term is too long, and the penalty is too high.

806
28:21.160 --> 28:22.070
This is different from what we talked about

807
28:22.070 --> 28:22.730
yesterday.

808
28:25.960 --> 28:26.680
Okay.

809
28:28.000 --> 28:29.680
Since we hit it off right away,

810
28:30.590 --> 28:32.590
I'll just collect the medical fees.

811
28:33.110 --> 28:34.110
And I won't charge you

812
28:34.110 --> 28:35.040
any extra money.

813
28:38.640 --> 28:40.440
Weren't you fired from your job?

814
28:41.200 --> 28:42.600
With such a big incident,

815
28:43.160 --> 28:44.200
in the short term,

816
28:44.200 --> 28:46.330
no hospital in Shenzhen will hire you.

817
28:46.550 --> 28:48.350
You might as well just stay here.

818
28:50.640 --> 28:51.770
That's impossible.

819
28:54.720 --> 28:55.590
Don't go.

820
28:55.790 --> 28:57.550
We just hit it off right away.

821
28:57.830 --> 28:58.960
Since you're here, you might as well stay.

822
28:58.960 --> 28:59.960
We agreed.

823
29:00.110 --> 29:02.440
Pay the money and do the job, nothing else.

824
29:04.440 --> 29:06.370
I don't want money. I just want you.

825
29:06.440 --> 29:07.680
If you don't stay,

826
29:07.680 --> 29:08.550
things won't be easy to handle.

827
29:08.550 --> 29:11.550
So you're the one responsible for my brother's death.

828
29:12.000 --> 29:12.750
Your brother is sick.

829
29:12.750 --> 29:13.440
What does that have to do with me?

830
29:13.440 --> 29:14.240
It didn't before,

831
29:14.240 --> 29:14.880
but it does now.

832
29:14.880 --> 29:15.750
What does it...

833
29:16.500 --> 29:18.160
What does it have to do with me?

834
29:19.240 --> 29:20.510
I run a hospital.

835
29:21.000 --> 29:22.800
Would I be afraid of dead people?

836
29:24.640 --> 29:25.840
That is your brother.

837
29:26.270 --> 29:27.800
You figure it out yourself.

838
29:29.550 --> 29:31.240
Why are you getting so anxious?

839
29:31.240 --> 29:31.900
President.

840
29:33.400 --> 29:33.930
Three...

841
29:34.720 --> 29:35.310
Two...

842
29:35.400 --> 29:35.960
Wait.

843
29:35.960 --> 29:36.540
One.

844
29:45.550 --> 29:47.880
What's the situation with the surgery?

845
29:47.880 --> 29:49.680
How did your brother arrange it?

846
29:49.880 --> 29:50.720
I don't know.

847
29:51.960 --> 29:53.030
He just told me

848
29:53.030 --> 29:54.030
to wait for news.

849
29:54.680 --> 29:55.310
Let me tell you,

850
29:55.310 --> 29:56.400
tonight,

851
29:56.400 --> 29:57.510
you need to go to bed early,

852
29:57.510 --> 29:58.200
you know?

853
29:58.550 --> 29:59.950
It'll be fine after this.

854
30:00.510 --> 30:01.310
My brother...

855
30:03.510 --> 30:04.510
Let me tell you, sis.

856
30:04.510 --> 30:05.640
He is cold-blooded.

857
30:07.960 --> 30:09.620
He never cares if I live or die.

858
30:11.070 --> 30:13.240
He never cared about me and my mom.

859
30:13.310 --> 30:14.930
Don't think like that.

860
30:15.200 --> 30:16.550
Besides your mom,

861
30:16.750 --> 30:18.880
isn't your brother the closest to you?

862
30:20.270 --> 30:22.000
How could he bear to ignore you?

863
30:22.920 --> 30:24.160
Go to sleep now.

864
30:24.550 --> 30:25.680
I'll go keep you company tomorrow,

865
30:25.680 --> 30:26.240
okay?

866
30:26.830 --> 30:27.440
Sis.

867
30:28.070 --> 30:28.790
Thank you.

868
30:29.550 --> 30:30.400
I'm telling the truth.

869
30:30.400 --> 30:33.000
I, Liu Zhengguang, have no skills in this life.

870
30:33.200 --> 30:33.680
I...

871
30:33.750 --> 30:36.350
But I really haven't suffered any grievances.

872
30:36.720 --> 30:39.400
Having friends like you makes it worth it.

873
30:39.400 --> 30:40.550
Even if tomorrow...

874
30:42.110 --> 30:42.830
I...

875
30:45.270 --> 30:46.030
I...

876
30:46.750 --> 30:48.240
Even if I suddenly drop dead tomorrow,

877
30:48.240 --> 30:49.200
and I'm gone,

878
30:49.200 --> 30:50.750
I'd still think it was worth it.

879
30:50.750 --> 30:52.000
Spit it out.

880
30:52.310 --> 30:54.040
You can't say things like that.

881
30:56.070 --> 30:56.960
Just listen to me.

882
30:56.960 --> 30:57.720
You will definitely

883
30:57.720 --> 30:59.070
get through this hurdle.

884
30:59.070 --> 30:59.880
When the time comes,

885
30:59.880 --> 31:02.140
you'll live to be around a hundred years.

886
31:02.350 --> 31:03.590
Then we'll find Aunt Ling,

887
31:03.590 --> 31:04.790
and we'll take her

888
31:04.790 --> 31:05.720
traveling,

889
31:05.880 --> 31:07.000
to enjoy life.

890
31:25.790 --> 31:27.160
Please, please.

891
31:28.200 --> 31:29.930
Help us find Aunt Ling sooner.

892
31:30.030 --> 31:30.960
With this little snow,

893
31:30.960 --> 31:32.350
once the sun comes out tomorrow,

894
31:32.350 --> 31:33.630
it'll melt by noon.

895
31:34.030 --> 31:35.110
And this too.

896
31:35.550 --> 31:36.790
Inaccurate when it should be,

897
31:36.790 --> 31:38.590
and accurate when it shouldn't.

898
31:38.880 --> 31:41.630
[Weather forecast]

899
31:43.880 --> 31:44.440
Then I can only use

900
31:44.440 --> 31:45.680
my childhood method.

901
31:46.640 --> 31:48.960
You should be staying at the hospital now,

902
31:48.960 --> 31:50.550
keeping Zhengguang company.

903
31:50.550 --> 31:51.920
He doesn't need my company.

904
31:51.920 --> 31:53.000
We despise each other.

905
31:52.800 --> 31:56.420
[Fucheng]

906
31:53.000 --> 31:54.240
Can't you provide your brother

907
31:54.240 --> 31:55.920
with some emotional value?

908
31:56.830 --> 31:58.440
You've done everything, but you don't express it.

909
31:58.440 --> 31:58.830
Aren't you going to stay

910
31:58.830 --> 32:00.200
at Xiaoximen soon?

911
32:00.200 --> 32:01.790
Who said I'm going to stay at Xiaoximen?

912
32:01.790 --> 32:03.070
Haven't you signed the contract?

913
32:03.070 --> 32:04.270
So what if I signed it?

914
32:04.400 --> 32:06.060
I'll leave after the surgery.

915
32:06.640 --> 32:08.770
At worst, I'll pay more compensation.

916
32:13.070 --> 32:14.730
What about tomorrow morning?

917
32:17.680 --> 32:19.340
I'm counting on you tomorrow.

918
32:20.110 --> 32:22.720
Don't let me see any snow.

919
32:23.110 --> 32:25.590
Don't worry, it's all arranged.

920
32:25.680 --> 32:27.880
Everything is under control.

921
32:36.640 --> 32:37.440
Is this what you meant by

922
32:37.440 --> 32:38.400
everything is under control?

923
32:38.400 --> 32:39.880
I had everything under control.

924
32:39.880 --> 32:40.640
I called a car.

925
32:40.640 --> 32:41.920
But he canceled the order.

926
32:41.920 --> 32:42.960
What do you have under control?

927
32:42.960 --> 32:44.200
Why didn't you check in advance?

928
32:44.200 --> 32:45.070
Look at the time.

929
32:45.070 --> 32:45.830
Don't panic yet.

930
32:45.830 --> 32:47.070
I'm more anxious than you, okay?

931
32:47.070 --> 32:47.720
How can I not be anxious?

932
32:47.720 --> 32:48.590
With such heavy snow,

933
32:48.590 --> 32:49.480
can we even get a car?

934
32:49.480 --> 32:51.200
We can get a car. Trust me!

935
32:51.200 --> 32:51.790
Trust me!

936
32:51.790 --> 32:53.350
If not, I'll call my buddy

937
32:53.350 --> 32:54.070
and ask him to pick us up.

938
32:54.070 --> 32:54.680
Call him right now!

939
32:54.680 --> 32:55.740
Call him right now!

940
32:56.920 --> 32:57.350
Wait a minute.

941
32:57.350 --> 32:58.200
Here comes one.

942
32:58.200 --> 32:59.790
I'll hail this one. This one...

943
32:59.790 --> 33:00.590
Where are you going?

944
33:00.590 --> 33:01.120
Don't...

945
33:03.640 --> 33:05.400
Sir, can you go to Xiaoximen?

946
33:05.400 --> 33:05.790
Go, go, go.

947
33:05.790 --> 33:06.830
Wait for me a moment!

948
33:06.830 --> 33:07.310
Okay.

949
33:09.350 --> 33:10.440
-Let’s go. Get off. -What car?

950
33:10.440 --> 33:11.200
A tuk-tuk. Hurry up.

951
33:11.200 --> 33:12.270
A... A tuk-tuk?

952
33:13.750 --> 33:14.160
Let's go.

953
33:14.160 --> 33:15.160
The snow is blowing in.

954
33:15.160 --> 33:16.200
There's no time.

955
33:16.200 --> 33:16.960
I won't take a tuk-tuk.

956
33:16.960 --> 33:17.160
They don't follow traffic rules.

957
33:17.160 --> 33:17.790
You're a grown adult.

958
33:17.790 --> 33:18.720
I can't carry you.

959
33:18.720 --> 33:19.720
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

960
33:19.720 --> 33:20.680
Let's go.

961
33:23.680 --> 33:24.270
Hurry.

962
33:24.270 --> 33:24.960
Wait a minute.

963
33:24.960 --> 33:26.420
I'll open the door for you.

964
33:26.680 --> 33:27.680
Get in.

965
33:28.510 --> 33:30.550
To Xiaoximen. Full speed ahead.

966
33:30.880 --> 33:31.720
Alright.

967
33:51.510 --> 33:52.440
Don't move.

968
33:52.640 --> 33:53.590
I'm... I'm not moving.

969
33:53.590 --> 33:54.520
Don't be afraid.

970
33:54.550 --> 33:55.880
I bought a hat for you.

971
33:55.880 --> 33:58.310
You can wear it when it's done.

972
33:59.440 --> 34:00.640
I'm not afraid at all.

973
34:05.920 --> 34:06.850
Are we there yet?

974
34:07.070 --> 34:08.550
Almost there. Almost.

975
34:10.400 --> 34:12.070
Hold tight. We're turning.

976
34:18.510 --> 34:19.280
We're here.

977
34:19.280 --> 34:20.190
-Are we? -Yes.

978
34:20.190 --> 34:20.850
Be careful.

979
34:21.030 --> 34:21.760
Sir, how much is it?

980
34:21.760 --> 34:22.290
Fifteen.

981
34:22.790 --> 34:23.280
Chen Junnan.

982
34:23.280 --> 34:25.810
-Keep the change. Let’s go. -Okay, thank you.

983
34:29.800 --> 34:31.000
He is both the chief surgeon

984
34:31.000 --> 34:32.320
and the patient's family member.

985
34:32.320 --> 34:33.280
Make sure he signs

986
34:33.280 --> 34:35.210
all the relevant documents later.

987
34:36.260 --> 34:37.920
[Treating patients with skill and compassion]

988
34:37.980 --> 34:44.620
[Outpatient Hall]

989
34:39.030 --> 34:40.290
I can't have snow on me.

990
34:41.800 --> 34:42.400
It's okay.

991
35:26.920 --> 35:27.590
Move over.

992
35:43.590 --> 35:45.120
Come on, give me the marker.

993
35:47.070 --> 35:47.800
Don't move.

994
35:47.920 --> 35:49.250
I'll mark the incision.

995
35:53.590 --> 35:55.050
Turn your head to the side.

996
36:01.840 --> 36:02.590
Brother.

997
36:04.880 --> 36:05.940
I don't want to die.

998
36:06.190 --> 36:07.190
You won't die.

999
36:09.760 --> 36:10.820
Let's pinky swear.

1000
36:10.920 --> 36:12.380
Keep your dirty hand away.

1001
36:16.420 --> 36:19.790
[Surgery Status Update]

1002
36:21.480 --> 36:23.100
[Liu Zhengguang; In Surgery; Neurosurgery; Bed 6]

1003
36:26.990 --> 36:30.070
[Operating Room]

1004
36:27.070 --> 36:28.200
Sit for a while, sis.

1005
36:41.760 --> 36:42.550
Scalp clip.

1006
36:56.510 --> 36:58.240
Prepare to open the dura mater.

1007
37:06.360 --> 37:07.320
Anesthesiologist.

1008
37:07.320 --> 37:08.920
Prepare to wake the patient.

1009
37:10.920 --> 37:13.070
[Quiet Please; Authorized Personnel Only]

1010
37:15.230 --> 37:16.160
Liu Zhengguang,

1011
37:16.880 --> 37:18.360
can you hear me?

1012
37:19.440 --> 37:20.230
Liu Zhengguang,

1013
37:20.230 --> 37:21.510
answer if you hear us.

1014
37:24.710 --> 37:25.640
Liu Zhengguang!

1015
37:25.960 --> 37:26.800
I hear you.

1016
37:29.480 --> 37:31.030
To ensure your language abilities

1017
37:31.030 --> 37:32.030
aren't affected,

1018
37:32.480 --> 37:33.280
for the next part,

1019
37:33.280 --> 37:33.920
I need you

1020
37:33.920 --> 37:35.030
to cooperate with me

1021
37:35.030 --> 37:36.160
while you are awake.

1022
37:37.030 --> 37:39.030
Prepare to start the language test.

1023
37:41.190 --> 37:42.150
Now,

1024
37:42.230 --> 37:44.760
try counting from one.

1025
37:46.400 --> 37:47.000
One.

1026
37:48.400 --> 37:48.920
Two.

1027
37:49.920 --> 37:50.800
Three.

1028
37:51.510 --> 37:52.670
Four...

1029
37:54.190 --> 37:55.190
Give me the label.

1030
37:57.710 --> 37:59.400
Count a bit slower, Liu Zhengguang.

1031
37:59.400 --> 38:00.190
Four.

1032
38:01.360 --> 38:02.150
Five.

1033
38:02.630 --> 38:03.510
Count slower.

1034
38:04.920 --> 38:05.710
Six.

1035
38:06.480 --> 38:07.630
Seven...

1036
38:10.320 --> 38:11.180
Come on, label.

1037
38:15.030 --> 38:15.800
Cotton pad.

1038
38:16.760 --> 38:17.670
Is my

1039
38:18.030 --> 38:19.400
head

1040
38:19.480 --> 38:22.110
open right now?

1041
38:22.480 --> 38:23.280
Yes.

1042
38:23.550 --> 38:24.800
But don't worry.

1043
38:24.920 --> 38:26.760
The surgery is going very smoothly.

1044
38:26.760 --> 38:27.940
I guess

1045
38:29.550 --> 38:31.140
I'm speaking

1046
38:31.960 --> 38:34.190
with an open mind now.

1047
38:37.320 --> 38:39.050
Can two people with type O blood

1048
38:40.230 --> 38:41.480
have

1049
38:42.630 --> 38:44.400
a child with type A blood?

1050
38:46.280 --> 38:47.210
What do you mean?

1051
38:47.480 --> 38:48.840
C-Can you repeat that?

1052
38:48.840 --> 38:49.670
I understand.

1053
38:50.510 --> 38:52.360
So this is your so-called

1054
38:52.360 --> 38:53.440
scientific proof?

1055
38:53.800 --> 38:54.760
My

1056
38:55.960 --> 38:57.880
parents both have

1057
38:59.280 --> 39:00.280
type O blood.

1058
39:04.230 --> 39:05.760
I have type A blood.

1059
39:07.440 --> 39:09.190
I checked online.

1060
39:09.280 --> 39:11.590
This is completely impossible.

1061
39:11.590 --> 39:13.000
Nothing is absolute.

1062
39:13.070 --> 39:14.840
Maybe the blood type was displayed incorrectly.

1063
39:14.840 --> 39:15.710
What if there's a

1064
39:15.710 --> 39:17.030
one in tens of thousands chance

1065
39:17.030 --> 39:18.290
of a genetic mutation,

1066
39:18.710 --> 39:19.800
and two type O parents

1067
39:19.800 --> 39:21.330
end up having a type A child?

1068
39:22.110 --> 39:23.550
Stop fooling me.

1069
39:23.880 --> 39:26.000
It's possible. I can testify.

1070
39:26.550 --> 39:27.400
What do you mean?

1071
39:27.400 --> 39:28.550
I... I... I...

1072
39:28.550 --> 39:30.110
I mu... mutated?

1073
39:30.110 --> 39:31.770
Alright, don't overthink it.

1074
39:31.800 --> 39:32.840
Get some more sleep.

1075
39:32.840 --> 39:34.300
I'll take care of the rest.

1076
39:43.510 --> 39:46.170
Prepare to resect the malformed blood vessels.

1077
39:49.930 --> 39:50.450
Dr. Liu.

1078
39:50.480 --> 39:51.400
The patient's blood pressure is dropping.

1079
39:51.400 --> 39:52.320
70 over 40.

1080
40:01.550 --> 40:03.360
Massive bleeding from the malformed vessels.

1081
40:03.360 --> 40:05.140
Administer norepinephrine.

1082
40:05.360 --> 40:06.960
Get 2 units of red blood cells

1083
40:06.960 --> 40:08.190
and 400 ml of plasma.

1084
40:09.720 --> 40:11.440
Stabilize the heart rate at around 80.

1085
40:11.440 --> 40:13.040
Give me a hemostatic sponge.

1086
40:16.000 --> 40:17.460
Give me hemostatic gauze.

1087
40:20.840 --> 40:21.630
Cotton pads.

1088
40:23.320 --> 40:24.720
Give me an aneurysm clip.

1089
40:41.470 --> 40:46.210
[No smoking]

1090
41:05.510 --> 41:06.760
Old Tower.

1091
41:07.630 --> 41:09.340
Please bless my brother.

1092
41:09.510 --> 41:11.110
May he never be afraid of snow again,

1093
41:11.110 --> 41:13.670
and stay home to play with me from now on.

1094
41:31.200 --> 41:34.100
[Starry Night] [Prosperous Dynasty]

1095
41:33.000 --> 41:34.330
I'm telling you, Zhuzi.

1096
41:34.510 --> 41:36.000
You could never imagine such a scene

1097
41:36.000 --> 41:37.110
in your entire life.

1098
41:37.110 --> 41:37.840
Right?

1099
41:37.840 --> 41:39.370
The head was cut right open.

1100
41:46.280 --> 41:48.110
Looking like a Martian.

1101
41:48.230 --> 41:50.090
Wait, how did you see it yourself?

1102
41:50.230 --> 41:51.280
I imagined it.

1103
41:52.360 --> 41:54.320
The most important thing is that's not the point.

1104
41:54.320 --> 41:55.030
Sis.

1105
41:55.320 --> 41:57.670
The point is I was talking and laughing cheerfully.

1106
41:57.670 --> 41:58.880
I was not scared at all.

1107
41:58.880 --> 41:59.880
That was awesome.

1108
41:59.880 --> 42:00.480
Really?

1109
42:00.800 --> 42:02.190
How come I remember the day before yesterday,

1110
42:02.190 --> 42:03.720
you almost peed your pants?

1111
42:04.630 --> 42:07.090
Liu Zhengliang is always contradicting me.

1112
42:12.920 --> 42:13.840
What's wrong?

1113
42:17.030 --> 42:18.110
See for yourself.

1114
42:19.110 --> 42:20.770
You didn't mess me up, did you?

1115
42:22.030 --> 42:22.840
Zhuzi,

1116
42:22.840 --> 42:24.370
crank the bed up a bit for me.

1117
42:29.740 --> 42:32.670
[Kinship Test Report]

1118
42:30.170 --> 42:30.840
The blood

1119
42:30.840 --> 42:32.510
was drawn during your physical examination.

1120
42:32.510 --> 42:34.230
The test results just came in.

1121
42:36.670 --> 42:37.710
What a pity.

1122
42:38.280 --> 42:39.920
Although the IQ gap between us

1123
42:39.920 --> 42:40.670
makes it look like we're not

1124
42:40.670 --> 42:41.710
the same species,

1125
42:42.190 --> 42:42.760
we are actually

1126
42:42.760 --> 42:44.280
biological brothers.

1127
42:46.150 --> 42:47.480
I was happy for nothing.

1128
42:48.320 --> 42:49.960
It's really a shame.

1129
42:51.550 --> 42:52.960
Such a shame!

1130
43:02.110 --> 43:03.510
What's the shame in that?

1131
43:08.630 --> 43:09.760
It's authentic.
